#: ../../solid/energy_bands.rst:2
msgid "エネルギーバンド"
msgstr "Energy Bands"

#: ../../solid/energy_bands.rst:4
msgid ""
":ref:`価電子帯・伝導帯とバンドギャップ<valence-conduction-band-gap>`\\ と\\ :ref:`状態密度"
"<density-of-states>`\\ "
"から始めます。タイト・バインディング模型では、原子軌道間のホッピングからバンドの形やギャップを求め、有限の長さの鎖の準位がバンドとどう対応するかを見ます。続いて、フェルミ準位と占有数、半導体の電気伝導へ進みます。"
msgstr ""
"We begin with the :ref:`valence band, conduction band, and band gap "
"<valence-conduction-band-gap>`\\  and the \\ :ref:`density of states "
"<density-of-states>`\\ . In the tight-binding model, we use hopping "
"between atomic orbitals to find band shapes and gaps, then see how the "
"levels of a finite chain correspond to the bands. We then turn to the "
"Fermi level and occupation numbers, followed by electrical conduction in "
"semiconductors."

